lf-contract 0.1
id lf-checked-abs/0
word lf-checked-abs
ir tests/program/ir/examples.ir
stack ( n -- magnitude true | false )
inputs n
statement For an integer n in the cell range: if n is the smallest cell the word returns false; otherwise it returns |n| and true, and |n| is in the cell range. Cells below are kept.
case n = cell.min
  out false
case n <> cell.min
  out m true
  ensure m = abs(n)
  ensure 0 <= m && m <= cell.max
expect discharged
